<title>SWEDEN: Saab AB deepens losses in '96.</title>
<headline>Saab AB deepens losses in '96.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish aerospace and defense group SAAB AB, held by investment company Investor AB, reported 1996 earnings on Thursday.</p>
<p>   (million crowns)			    '96	 '95</p>
<p> Result after fin items		  LOSS 908 vs   316 PROFIT</p>
<p> Operating result			LOSS 1,402 vs   354 LOSS</p>
<p> Sales					    8,249 vs 7,925</p>
<p> Operating costs				8,312 vs 7,622</p>
<p> Depreciation				   1,464 vs   547</p>
<p> Interests in associates			  3 vs     1</p>
<p> Net financial items			    494 vs   670</p>
<p> Tax				     CREDIT   219 vs   121 CHARGE</p>
<p> Minorities					  13 vs    11</p>
<p> Net result			     LOSS    702 vs   184 PROFIT</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
